{"title":"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are positive real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d16057e5cc12818247c137cd3da0790218b64a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{\\log_3 7} = 27$\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/7/347905205fef49565cba2840245c412b407c3c6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{\\log_7 11} = 49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/8/358afe994d5b60ac646119c774f8aa74daa520d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{\\log_{11}25} = \\sqrt{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />. Find\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/0/680c5fe965e912d7a3cbf4cf823fe104d86d3124.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^{(\\log_3 7)^2} + b^{(\\log_7 11)^2} + c^{(\\log_{11} 25)^2}.\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f76c9c999e1420dd3c53d8ae7234693c3ee3ab57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{(\\log_y z)^2} = x^{\\left( (\\log_y z)^2 \\right) } = x^{(\\log_y z) \\cdot (\\log_y z) } = \\left( x^{\\log_y z} \\right)^{\\log_y z}\\]\" width=\"406\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>Now, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e9e82f1303556be13fd2ee0d668f847a6ea1bf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y^w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" />, then we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/b/f9b1389de58394163d7255c83166d35a6cafd033.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{\\log_y z}  = \\left( y^w \\right)^{\\log_y z}  = y^{w\\log_y z}  = y^{\\log_y (z^w)}  = z^w\\]\" width=\"346\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>This is all we need to evaluate the given formula. Note that in our case we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/b/dabdd18e0c3e1334358125b39d05cde6e25a777a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27=3^3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a489e35824935243a757995a66af4a158d77be20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49=7^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/19912783c39f5769907b3cb766175238a1c53904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{11}=11^{1/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />. We can now compute:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/c/5fcca61e8df21a948b018cd8a897d88526c284aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^{(\\log_3 7)^2} = \\left( a^{\\log_3 7} \\right)^{\\log_3 7} = 27^{\\log_3 7} = (3^3)^{\\log_3 7} = 7^3 = 343\\]\" width=\"431\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>Similarly, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/2/ae280c7340770d1e8ddb9a87ab0807a078e19641.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{(\\log_7 11)^2}  = (7^2)^{\\log_7 11} = 11^2  = 121\\]\" width=\"259\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa762479266a6f6fef5325e9b7d2a7ea1c36f623.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c^{(\\log_{11} 25)^2} = (11^{1/2})^{\\log_{11} 25} = 25^{1/2} = 5\\]\" width=\"289\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>and therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/5/875ce33a87aefdced358b92225a3ec17a5dd33b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$343+121+5 = \\boxed{469}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"171\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know from the first three equations that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b8d7596759f7a19fbd88ba6e577412a363dadbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a27 = \\log_37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d45f9a4a47aa9a0a53081dbf06c2d783f59e700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b49 = \\log_711$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f7207d4e4a3fb8e51cefc02a5af71cec1e97fe07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_c\\sqrt{11} = \\log_{11}25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"24\" />. Substituting, we find\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/0/3a04a2b78fff331c7b136253b9df0736aec62f84.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^{(\\log_a27)(\\log_37)} + b^{(\\log_b49)(\\log_711)} + c^{(\\log_c\\sqrt {11})(\\log_{11}25)}.\\]\" width=\"382\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/e/42e6f5ec5ac2e33d498989fcde373a12f6a1bba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\log_xy} =y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"19\" />, so we find\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/0/0c016e74887f12aaf88e9a5814188cc4107a167b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[27^{\\log_37} + 49^{\\log_711} + \\sqrt {11}^{\\log_{11}25}\\]\" width=\"231\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/6/e66beae1e9a6f55906a06d0cef3e156565595883.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(3^{\\log_37})^3 + (7^{\\log_711})^2 + ({11^{\\log_{11}25}})^{1/2}.\\]\" width=\"280\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/1/b31b7d22508eaeac22157a7ac507b54f6f396087.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> cancel to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and we can do this for the other two terms. Thus, our answer is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d83f89252c2d931829a90f3b2e2fe40b7b0c0ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7^3 + 11^2 + 25^{1/2}\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d3af017fca00d1776bf17a695c4dbd356a729e6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 343 + 121 + 5\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cf083b2aa7e8554499eaca32f50b375d0288191.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\boxed {469}.\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, let us take the log base 3 of the first expression. We get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebbdfeb12ebc12533e83777cfb47049a2828f1da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_3{a^{\\log_3{7}}} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"22\" />. Simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e3abc4e81ab8a4b326b499d5c036d722a5cad60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log_3{7})(\\log_3{a}) = 3\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/9/a794a260066f401b1ccb781a8ca03127d52c11af.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_3 a = \\frac{3}{\\log_3{7}}\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"41\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2ed115f9932d4afcaa78f6040c5e20b184a79bb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = 3^\\frac{3}{log_3{7}}\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />. We can repeat the same process for the other equations, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73ca51e39002e30a65ddde6556a54182c8015ca2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = 7^\\frac{2}{\\log_7{11}}\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/d/20d9ed21b3f082c8ff27290d9bd771f27eb9279a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[c = (\\sqrt{11})^\\frac{1}{\\log_ {11}{25}}\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"23\" />. Raising <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to the power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836e122dee7db71eb09670ed6aba01fa4d4fca7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_3{7})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"21\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/5/5b5acc426780cc00cf5901f50650baa6c09bbe08.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3^{3\\log_3{7}} = 3^{\\log_3{343}} = 343\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"15\" />. Repeating a similar process for the other ones(you have to turn the square root to a fractional power for c), we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/5/875ce33a87aefdced358b92225a3ec17a5dd33b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$343+121+5 = \\boxed{469}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"171\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~idk12345678\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II\" title=\"2009 AIME II\">2009 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017220547\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.115 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 281/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7617/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.365      1 -total\n 57.50%    9.410      1 Template:AIME_box\n 40.60%    6.645      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8041:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017220547 and revision id 219192. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}